績等に応じて追加対価を受領する条件付取得対価（アーンアウト条項）が含まれており、特別利益に含め計上しています。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["PreviousReportingDateOfDividendForecast", "PreviousReportingDateOfDividendForecast", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "（―年―月―日発表）", null, "CurrentYearInstant_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 59.67, "59.67", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 59.67, "59.67", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 74.35, "74.35", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 74.35, "74.35", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 56.91, "56.91", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 56.91, "56.91", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["ReasonForDividendForecastCorrection", "ReasonForDividendForecastCorrection", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "当社は、株主の皆様からの信頼に応え、安定的かつ継続的な利益還元を行うことを経営上の重要課題の一つと考えております。2026 年12 月期より、連結配当性向65％、または株主資本配当率（DOE）4％のいずれか高い方を目安に、安定的かつ継続的な配当を実施することを基本方針とし、株主還元の強化を図っております。当社の株主還元方針および業績予想の上方修正を踏まえ、株主の皆様に対しより高い利益還元を行うこととし、期末配当は前回予想の1 株当たり59.67 円から14.68 円増配し、74.35 円とさせていただく予定であります。なお、株主資本配当率（DOE）は、為替換算調整勘定を除く自己資本をベースとして算出しております。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["FiscalYearEnd", "FiscalYearEnd", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2026-12-31", null, "CurrentYearInstant"]]}}